flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7337238Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7338293Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7339194Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7339854Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7340125Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7340898Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7341344Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7341674Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7342204Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7342434Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7342880Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7343441Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7343911Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7344300Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7344504Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7344687Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7344995Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7345221Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7345632Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7345761Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7345948Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7346111Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7346580Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
