flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7347943Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7348299Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7348755Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7349408Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7350037Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7351235Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7351661Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7351993Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7352462Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7353065Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T08:36:14.7363442Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
